What are Perishable Prepared Foods?
Perishable prepared foods encompass ready-to-eat meals and prepared food items that require refrigeration to maintain safety and quality. These products include fresh-cut fruits and vegetables, fully cooked entrees, salads, sandwiches, and plant-based alternatives, all designed for convenience while demanding strict cold chain management.
This market segment has evolved significantly, with products now featuring extended shelf lives through advanced packaging technologies while maintaining freshness and nutritional integrity. The sector has demonstrated remarkable innovation, particularly in response to consumer demand for transparency and natural ingredients.
